      "field": "description",
      "before": "Make a lasting impression with this Purple Rayon Silk Sherwani, crafted from premium rayon silk fabric with elegant highlight embroidery. Designed with a sophisticated Bandhgala neckline, full sleeves, and a button closure, this sherwani offers a regal and refined look. Paired with cream Aligarhi pants and a matching dupatta, it is an ideal choice for weddings, receptions, engagements, and grand festive celebrations.\nKey Features\nPremium Purple Rayon Silk Fabric\nElegant Highlight Embroidery\nClassic Bandhgala Neckline\nFull Sleeves with Button Closure\nAbove-Length Sherwani\nCream Aligarhi Pants & Matching Dupatta Included\nIdeal for Weddings, Receptions, Engagements & Festive Occasions\nStyling Tips\nPair with black juttis for a classic royal look.\nStyle with black leather shoes for evening receptions and formal celebrations.\nComplete the ensemble with maroon slip-on shoes for a refined festive appearance.",
      "after": "Purple Rayon Silk Sherwani with Dupatta & Aligarhi Pant for Men. This 3-piece set includes: Sherwani, Dupatta, and Aligarhi. Fabric: Rayon. Composition percentages are not stated. Colour: Purple, bottoms in Cream. Design: Bandhgala, full sleeves, button closure, jacquard. Fit type is not stated. Sizes 38–50 are chest sizes in inches: pick your chest measurement, as fitting ease is already included. Garment chest runs 41–53 in, shoulder 18–21 in. The model is listed as 6ft and wearing size 40 (merchant to confirm for this shoot). In stock at capture: 38, 40, 42, 44 (of 38, 40, 42, 44, 46, 48, 50). Care: dry clean only. Listed occasions: Wedding, Reception, and Office Party Wear. Price: ₹ 47,680 MRP, inclusive of all taxes.",
